      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see, i'll keep it to a medium layer then. i'm just really trying to avoid the hospital because the costs are so high and i really don't think this is that serious since it's just a bit of redness. if it does start to look like it's blistering a little more, is there any way i can just use more of the oil to \"seal\" the blisters so they don't pop? i'd rather just handle it at home with these natural remedies than deal with a doctor if i can help it.",
